<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The above unaudited financial results have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and thereafter approved and taken on record by the Board of Directors in their respective meetings held on February 11, 2021. These unaudited financial results have been prepared in accordance with the Indian Accounting Standards ( Ind-AS ) as specified under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 read with the Rule 3 of the Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules, 2015 (as amended from time to time) and the provisions of the Companies Act, 2013. 2.Other income for the 3 months ended 31 December 2020, 30 September 2020, 31 December 2019 and 9 months ended 31 December 2020, 31 December 2019 and 12 months ended 31  March 2020 includes profit on sale of property, plant &amp; equipment's of  Rs. 114.53 lakhs, Rs. 1,286.49 lakhs, Rs. Nil, Rs. 1,401.02 lakhs, Rs. 297.38 lakhs and Rs. 283.63 lakhs respectively. For the quarter ended 31 December 2019, loss on sale of fixed asset amounting to Rs. 33.83 lakhs is grouped under other expenses. 3.Company have opted for an irrevocable option to present in other comprehensive income subsequent changes in the fair value of an investment in an equity instrument. Similarly being a derivative instrument, loss on fair valuation of call obligation account have been recognised through profit and loss account. 4.The Statutory Auditors of the Company have conducted limited review of the unaudited financial results of the Company for the quarter ended 31 December 2020. An unqualified conclusion has been issued by them thereon.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
